    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, Nitori was doing research on new inventions just like she always did. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But just then, she received a report from a fellow kappa. She'd witnessed the appearance of some strange machines. &quot;What kind of machines were they, then? Huh? Flying ones? Oh, well, now I HAVE to see them for myself!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And thus began Nitori's journey to figure out what these machines were. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a Touhou Project fangame. It's a shooting game where you defeat bosses while dodging danmaku. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your weaponry to one of 576 possible combinations, and overcome the danmaku coming your way! </p>",
